{"help": "https://open.canada.ca/data/api/3/action/help_show?name=package_show", "success": true, "result": {"association_type": [], "audience": [], "author": null, "author_email": null, "collection": "primary", "contributor": {"en": "", "fr": ""}, "creator": "", "creator_user_id": "2dc5a12f-2a6f-4822-8514-165ea6bb05d9", "data_series_issue_identification": {"en": "", "fr": ""}, "data_series_name": {"en": "", "fr": ""}, "date_published": "2023-09-13 00:00:00", "digital_object_identifier": "", "display_flags": [], "frequency": "as_needed", "geographic_region": [], "id": "4f344cd6-0912-411a-ae16-41ea160cc8b5", "imso_approval": "true", "isopen": false, "jurisdiction": "federal", "keywords": {"en": ["occupation", "skill", "ability", "work", "job", "career", "vocation", "rehabilitation", "task", "employment"], "fr": ["profession", "comp\u00e9tence", "habilet\u00e9", "travail", "aptitude", "carri\u00e8re", "vocation", "r\u00e9adaptation", "t\u00e2che", "emploi"]}, "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "license_title": "Open Government Licence - Canada", "license_url": "https://open.canada.ca/en/open-government-licence-canada", "maintainer": null, "maintainer_contact_form": {}, "maintainer_email": "NC-CNP-NOC-GD@hrsdc-rhdcc.gc.ca", "metadata_contact": {}, "metadata_created": "2025-08-29T22:41:02.298013", "metadata_modified": "2025-08-29T22:41:02.298019", "name": "4f344cd6-0912-411a-ae16-41ea160cc8b5", "notes": "The Occupational and Skills Information System (OaSIS) provides a comprehensive framework of the skills and competencies that are usually required to work in different occupations. It also provides context for the work environment in which these occupations are performed.\r\n\r\nThis dataset provides information on 900 occupations including ratings for over 240 descriptors belonging to one of the following categories: Skills, Abilities, Personal attributes, Knowledge, Interests, Work activities and Work context. Standardized dimensions and scales were established at the category level for all categories, except Work context, for which specific dimensions and scales were adopted.\r\n\r\nAll the descriptors under Skills and Abilities have ratings attributed by proficiency level required by occupation on a scale of 1 to 5. Descriptors under Personal attributes are measured by Importance on a scale of 1 to 5. Descriptors under Knowledge are measured by the knowledge level on a scale of 1 to3. Descriptors under Interests are measured by predominance ranking of Holland Codes. Descriptors under Work activities are measured by complexity on a scale of 1 to 5. Descriptors under Work context are measured by one or two of the following dimensions: \r\n\r\n- **Frequency (1-5 scale)**\r\n    - 1 - Once a year or more but not every month \r\n    - 2 - Once a month or more but not every week\r\n    - 3 - Once a week or more but not every day\r\n    - 4 - Every day, a few times per day\r\n    - 5 - Every day, many times per day\r\n- **Duration (1-5 scale)**\r\n    - 1 - Very little time\r\n    - 2 - Less than half the time\r\n    - 3 - About half the time\r\n    - 4 - More than half the time\r\n    - 5 - All the time, or almost all the time\r\n- Degree of responsibility (1-5 scale)\r\n- Physical distance from others (1-5 scale)\r\n- Degree of consequence of error (1-5 scale)\r\n- Degree of impact (1-5 scale)\r\n- Degree of freedom to make decisions (1-5 scale)\r\n- Degree of freedom to determine tasks and priorities (1-5 scale)\r\n- Degree of competition (1-5 scale)\r\n- Degree of automation (1-3 scale)\r\n- Work schedule (1-3 scale)\r\n- Worked hours in a typical week (1-3 scale)\r\n\r\nThis dataset is of national relevance.\r\n", "notes_translated": {"en": "The Occupational and Skills Information System (OaSIS) provides a comprehensive framework of the skills and competencies that are usually required to work in different occupations. It also provides context for the work environment in which these occupations are performed.\r\n\r\nThis dataset provides information on 900 occupations including ratings for over 240 descriptors belonging to one of the following categories: Skills, Abilities, Personal attributes, Knowledge, Interests, Work activities and Work context. Standardized dimensions and scales were established at the category level for all categories, except Work context, for which specific dimensions and scales were adopted.\r\n\r\nAll the descriptors under Skills and Abilities have ratings attributed by proficiency level required by occupation on a scale of 1 to 5. Descriptors under Personal attributes are measured by Importance on a scale of 1 to 5. Descriptors under Knowledge are measured by the knowledge level on a scale of 1 to3. Descriptors under Interests are measured by predominance ranking of Holland Codes. Descriptors under Work activities are measured by complexity on a scale of 1 to 5. Descriptors under Work context are measured by one or two of the following dimensions: \r\n\r\n- **Frequency (1-5 scale)**\r\n    - 1 - Once a year or more but not every month \r\n    - 2 - Once a month or more but not every week\r\n    - 3 - Once a week or more but not every day\r\n    - 4 - Every day, a few times per day\r\n    - 5 - Every day, many times per day\r\n- **Duration (1-5 scale)**\r\n    - 1 - Very little time\r\n    - 2 - Less than half the time\r\n    - 3 - About half the time\r\n    - 4 - More than half the time\r\n    - 5 - All the time, or almost all the time\r\n- Degree of responsibility (1-5 scale)\r\n- Physical distance from others (1-5 scale)\r\n- Degree of consequence of error (1-5 scale)\r\n- Degree of impact (1-5 scale)\r\n- Degree of freedom to make decisions (1-5 scale)\r\n- Degree of freedom to determine tasks and priorities (1-5 scale)\r\n- Degree of competition (1-5 scale)\r\n- Degree of automation (1-3 scale)\r\n- Work schedule (1-3 scale)\r\n- Worked hours in a typical week (1-3 scale)\r\n\r\nThis dataset is of national relevance.\r\n", "fr": "Le Syst\u00e8me d\u2019information sur les professions et les comp\u00e9tences (SIPeC) fournit un cadre complet des comp\u00e9tences et des capacit\u00e9s habituellement requises pour travailler dans diff\u00e9rentes professions. Il fournit \u00e9galement un contexte pour l'environnement de travail dans lequel ces professions sont exerc\u00e9es.\r\n\r\nCet ensemble de donn\u00e9es fournit des informations sur 900 professions, y compris des cotes pour plus de 240 descripteurs appartenant \u00e0 l'une des cat\u00e9gories suivantes : Comp\u00e9tences, Habilet\u00e9s, Attributs personnels, Connaissances, Int\u00e9r\u00eats, Activit\u00e9s du travail et Contexte de travail. Des dimensions et \u00e9chelles standardis\u00e9es ont \u00e9t\u00e9 \u00e9tablies au niveau des cat\u00e9gories pour toutes les cat\u00e9gories, \u00e0 l'exception du Contexte de travail, pour lequel des dimensions et \u00e9chelles sp\u00e9cifiques ont \u00e9t\u00e9 adopt\u00e9es.\r\n\r\nTous les descripteurs sous Comp\u00e9tences et Habilet\u00e9s ont des cotes attribu\u00e9es selon le niveau de comp\u00e9tence requis par la profession sur une \u00e9chelle de 1 \u00e0 5. Les descripteurs sous Attributs personnels sont mesur\u00e9s par importance sur une \u00e9chelle de 1 \u00e0 5. Les descripteurs sous Connaissances sont mesur\u00e9s par le niveau de connaissances sur une \u00e9chelle de 1 \u00e0 3. Les descripteurs sous Int\u00e9r\u00eats sont mesur\u00e9s par le classement de pr\u00e9dominance des codes Holland. Les descripteurs sous Activit\u00e9s de travail sont mesur\u00e9s par complexit\u00e9 sur une \u00e9chelle de 1 \u00e0 5. Les descripteurs sous Contexte de travail sont mesur\u00e9s par une ou deux des dimensions suivantes :\r\n\r\n- **Fr\u00e9quence (\u00c9chelle : 1-5)**\r\n    - 1 - Une fois ou plus par ann\u00e9e mais pas \u00e0 chaque mois\r\n    - 2 - Une fois ou plus par mois mais pas \u00e0 chaque semaine\r\n    - 3 - Une fois ou plus par semaine mais pas \u00e0 chaque jour\r\n    - 4 - Tous les jours, quelques fois par jour\r\n    - 5 - Tous les jours, plusieurs fois par jour\r\n- **Dur\u00e9e (\u00c9chelle : 1-5)**\r\n    - 1 - Tr\u00e8s peu de temps\r\n    - 2 - Moins de la moiti\u00e9 du temps\r\n    - 3 - Environ la moiti\u00e9 du temps\r\n    - 4 - Plus de la moiti\u00e9 du temps\r\n    - 5 - Tout le temps, ou presque tout le temps\r\n- Degr\u00e9 de responsabilit\u00e9 (\u00c9chelle : 1-5)\r\n- La distance physique des autres (\u00c9chelle : 1-5)\r\n- Degr\u00e9 de cons\u00e9quence de l\u2019erreur (\u00c9chelle : 1-5)\r\n- Degr\u00e9 d\u2019impact (\u00c9chelle : 1-5)\r\n- Degr\u00e9 de libert\u00e9 de d\u00e9cision (\u00c9chelle : 1-5)\r\n- Degr\u00e9 de libert\u00e9 pour d\u00e9terminer les taches et les priorit\u00e9s (\u00c9chelle : 1-5)\r\n- Degr\u00e9 de comp\u00e9tition (\u00c9chelle : 1-5)\r\n- Degr\u00e9 d\u2019automatisation (\u00c9chelle : 1-3)\r\n- Horaire de travail (\u00c9chelle : 1-3)\r\n- Heures travaill\u00e9es dans une semaine typique (\u00c9chelle : 1-3)\r\n\r\nCe jeu de donn\u00e9es est repr\u00e9sentatif au niveau national.\r\n"}, "num_resources": 32, "num_tags": 0, "org_section": {"en": "", "fr": ""}, "org_title_at_publication": {"en": "Employment and Social Development Canada", "fr": "Emploi et D\u00e9veloppement social Canada"}, "organization": {"id": "055ADCD8-8FDA-40DA-A5B7-689FF7DB57A6", "name": "esdc-edsc", "title": "Employment and Social Development Canada | Emploi et D\u00e9veloppement social Canada", "type": "organization", "description": "", "image_url": "", "created": "2016-09-23T17:25:26.246118", "is_organization": true, "approval_status": "approved", "state": "active"}, "owner_org": "055ADCD8-8FDA-40DA-A5B7-689FF7DB57A6", "place_of_publication": [], "portal_release_date": "2025-08-29", "position_name": {}, "private": false, "program_page_url": {"en": "https://noc.esdc.gc.ca/OaSIS/OaSISWelcome", "fr": "https://noc.esdc.gc.ca/Oasis/OasisWelcome?GoCTemplateCulture=fr-CA"}, "ready_to_publish": "true", "restrictions": "unrestricted", "spatial": "", "spatial_representation_type": [], "state": "active", "subject": ["economics_and_industry", "education_and_training", "form_descriptors", "labour"], "title": "Occupational and Skills Information System (OaSIS) 2023 Version 1.0", "title_translated": {"en": "Occupational and Skills Information System (OaSIS) 2023 Version 1.0", "fr": "Syst\u00e8me d\u2019information sur les professions et les comp\u00e9tences (SIPeC) 2023 Version 1.0"}, "topic_category": [], "type": "dataset", "url": null, "version": null, "resources": [{"cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "character_set": "", "created": "2025-08-29T22:41:02.306220", "data_quality": [], "datastore_active": true, "datastore_contains_all_records_of_source_file": false, "date_published": "", "description": null, "format": "CSV", "hash": "3c86b9500d58bc08e3f61737072bc23a", "id": "0ee24456-1c35-41a4-ac7d-e1422e5e2117", "language": ["en"], "last_modified": "2025-08-27T17:45:51.296532", "metadata_modified": "2025-08-29T22:41:02.251669", "mimetype": null, "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "Guide 2023 v1.0", "name_translated": {"en": "Guide 2023 v1.0", "fr": "Guide 2023 v1.0"}, "package_id": "4f344cd6-0912-411a-ae16-41ea160cc8b5", "position": 0, "resource_type": "guide", "state": "active", "unique_identifier": "", "url": "https://open.canada.ca/data/dataset/4f344cd6-0912-411a-ae16-41ea160cc8b5/resource/0ee24456-1c35-41a4-ac7d-e1422e5e2117/download/guide_oasis_2023_v1.0.csv", "url_type": "upload", "validation_status": "success", "validation_timestamp": "2025-08-27T17:45:55.703275"}, {"cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "character_set": "", "created": "2025-08-29T22:41:02.306223", "data_quality": [], "datastore_active": true, "datastore_contains_all_records_of_source_file": false, "date_published": "", "description": null, "format": "CSV", "hash": "fd8166327f5ab0cd2a527a51e91a8552", "id": "147f5c1a-f90e-4787-86a0-dff4ec19855e", "language": ["fr"], "last_modified": "2025-08-27T17:46:49.629038", "metada